-400\">/mo</span></p>\n          <ul className=\"mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600\">\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} className=\"text-rose-600\" /> Everything in Growth</li>\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} className=\"text-rose-600\" /> Dedicated manager</li>\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} className=\"text-rose-600\" /> Custom integrations</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"mt-6 block rounded-md border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold transition-colors\">Choose Scale</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Stats.tsx":"export default function Stats() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-2 gap-8 px-6 py-16 text-center md:grid-cols-4\">\n        <div><p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-rose-300 md:text-4xl\">500+</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Clients served</p></div>\n        <div><p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-rose-300 md:text-4xl\">10 yrs</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">In business</p></div>\n        <div><p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-rose-300 md:text-4xl\">4.9/5</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Avg. rating</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Features.tsx":"export default function Features() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">What Orbit offers</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Orbit does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 space-y-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100 to-slate-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">One clear promise</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">A single, sharp value proposition above the fold.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-rose-50 md:order-2\" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Social proof</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Real numbers, real logos, real quotes.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100 to-slate-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Simple pricing</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">No confusing tiers, no hidden fees.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Stats","Features","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Pricing","path":"/pricing","slug":"pricing","sections":["Navbar","Pricing","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '198a7f40-9540-48f6-9168-a7e18a613dff'::uuid;
