-white transition-colors\">Explore</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-16 hidden max-w-sm rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur md:block\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm text-white/70\">Trusted by teams who need it to just work.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-14 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-sm\">\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-lg font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Whitfield & Cross</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">Whitfield & Cross specializes in the contracts and disputes that actually come up for growing businesses.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"/services\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Services</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"border-t border-slate-200\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Whitfield & Cross. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600\" /> Built with webma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Tell us a bit about what you need — we'll take it from there.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-lg bg-amber-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Services</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">A closer look at what we do and how we do it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-normal text-slate-900\">About Whitfield & Cross</h2>\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p className=\"text-slate-600\">Behind Whitfield & Cross is a small, focused team that cares more about doing the work right than doing a lot of it. That's shaped everything about how we operate.</p>\n          <div className=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-slate-500\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-square rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-slate-100\" />\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-slate-900\">&ldquo;Formation, contracts, and governance. That's exactly what Whitfield & Cross delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Owen Clarke</p>\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Founder</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Features.tsx":"import { Zap, Star, Shield, Sparkles, Target, Heart, Award, TrendingUp, Users, Clock, CheckCircle, Compass } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Features() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">What Whitfield & Cross offers</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Whitfield & Cross does best.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-10 divide-y divide-slate-200\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Zap size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Corporate law</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Formation, contracts, and governance.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Star size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Litigation</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Civil disputes handled with a trial-ready posture.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Shield size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Estate planning</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Wills, trusts, and succession planning.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Sparkles size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Contract review</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Clear terms before you sign anything.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Target size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Employment law</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Policy review and workplace dispute resolution.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Heart size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Real estate law</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Closings, leases, and title review.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Features","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Services","path":"/services","slug":"services","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Features","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '7a5d4f1c-d859-4db1-98c8-4500c6b5f064'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"bg-white\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Harbor Post</a>\n        <div className=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/sections\" className=\"border-b-2 border-transparent pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 hover:border-amber-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Sections</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"border-b-2 border-transparent pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 hover:border-amber-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Subscribe</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-36\">\n        <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-amber-300\">MEDIA</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] mt-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight\">Reporting worth paying for.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/60\">Independent, subscriber-funded, no algorithm deciding what you see.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-sm bg-amber-500 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors\">Get in touch</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-sm border border-white/20 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\">Explore</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Harbor Post</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm text-white/50\">Independent, subscriber-funded, no algorithm deciding what you see.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-white/40\">Stay in the loop</p>\n            <form className=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\" onSubmit={(e) => e.preventDefault()}>\n              <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@email.com\" className=\"w-full rounded-sm border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/30 focus:border-amber-400 focus:outline-none\" />\n              <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-sm bg-amber-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors\">Join</button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/sections\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Sections</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Subscribe</a>\n          </div>\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Harbor Post</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Questions, quotes, or just saying hello — we'd love to hear from you.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-sm border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-sm border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-sm border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-sm bg-amber-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 text-center\">\n        <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-amber-600\">Real work, real results — see it for yourself.</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Sections</h1>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Latest.tsx":"import { Zap, Star, Shield, Sparkles, Target, Heart, Award, TrendingUp, Users, Clock, CheckCircle, Compass } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Latest() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Courier_New',ui-monospace,monospace] text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Latest updates</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Recent posts and announcements.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-10 divide-y divide-slate-200\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Zap size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Local coverage</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Reporting on the stories national outlets skip.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Star size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Investigations</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Long-form reporting, months in the making.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Shield size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Daily briefing</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">The five things worth knowing this morning.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Sparkles size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Opinion</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Perspective from writers who know the beat.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Latest","Footer"]},{"name":"Sections","path":"/sections","slug":"sections","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Latest","Footer"]},{"name":"Subscribe","path":"/contact","slug":"subscribe","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = 'ab657daf-6144-472f-9363-cad7c2b1e998'::uuid;
