xt-white hover:border-white transition-colors\">See how it works</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-16 hidden max-w-sm rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur md:block\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm text-white/70\">Trusted by teams who need it to just work.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-14 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-sm\">\n          <p className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Ava Cole</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">Freelance product design for startups and design teams who want a second, senior set of eyes.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"/about\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">About</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"border-t border-slate-200\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Ava Cole. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-600\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600\" /> Built with webma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">Everything you need to know about how we approach design.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-orange-50 md:order-2\" />\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About Ava Cole</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-slate-600\">Behind Ava Cole is a small, focused team that cares more about doing the work right than doing a lot of it. That's shaped everything about how we operate.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Work.tsx":"export default function Work() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Selected work</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Ava Cole does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 space-y-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-orange-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Product design</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Onboarding, dashboards, and end-to-end flows.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-emerald-50 md:order-2\" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Design systems</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Component libraries adopted across whole product teams.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-orange-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Mobile apps</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">0 to 1 design for iOS and Android products.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Work","About","Footer"]},{"name":"About","path":"/about","slug":"about","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","About","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '115300de-d80f-460c-8ba1-4588e5f87aa2'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-white\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-3 items-center px-6 py-5\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/about\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">About</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-center text-xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Field Design Co</a>\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-violet-600 hover:text-violet-700\">Contact →</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-violet-600 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-32\">\n        \n        <h1 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[0.98] tracking-normal\">A portfolio of shipped work, not concepts.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg text-white/85\">Every project here went live — nothing is a mockup.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-lg bg-white px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-violet-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors\">Start now</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-white/50 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white transition-colors\">View details</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-xl font-bold tracking-normal\">Field Design Co</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm text-white/50\">Every project here went live — nothing is a mockup.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-normal text-white/40\">Stay in the loop</p>\n            <form className=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\" onSubmit={(e) => e.preventDefault()}>\n              <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@email.com\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/30 focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none\" />\n              <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-lg bg-violet-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-violet-400 transition-colors\">Join</button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/about\" className=\"hover:text-white\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Contact</a>\n          </div>\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Field Design Co</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-violet-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-violet-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-violet-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-lg bg-violet-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-violet-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">About</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">Everything you need to know about how we approach design.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-50 to-lime-50 md:order-2\" />\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">About Field Design Co</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-slate-600\">Field Design Co pairs real experience in design with a genuine focus on the people we work with — no jargon, no unnecessary steps, just results.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Work.tsx":"export default function Work() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Selected work</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Field Design Co does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-4xl font-bold text-violet-200\">01</p>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Product design</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Onboarding, dashboards, and end-to-end flows.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-4xl font-bold text-violet-200\">02</p>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Design systems</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Component libraries adopted across whole product teams.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-4xl font-bold text-violet-200\">03</p>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Mobile apps</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">0 to 1 design for iOS and Android products.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-4xl font-bold text-violet-200\">04</p>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Brand & identity</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Logo, type, and visual systems.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-4xl font-bold text-violet-200\">05</p>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-900\">UX research</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">User interviews and usability testing that actually change roadmaps.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Work","About","Footer"]},{"name":"About","path":"/about","slug":"about","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","About","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '88c92546-1478-471d-a5cb-6db2c1f9a520'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"bg-indigo-600\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white\">Kai Osei</a>\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/about\" className=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">About</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-md bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-indigo-600 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-32\">\n        <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-white/70\">DESIGN</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] mt-4 text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-[0.98] tracking-tight\">Interfaces that get out of the user's way.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg text-white/85\">Ten years designing for early-stage startups, most recently as a founding designer at two YC companies.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-md bg-white px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors\">Start now</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-md border border-white/50 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white transition-colors\">View details</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-14 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-sm\">\n          <p className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Kai Osei</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">Ten years designing for early-stage startups, most recently as a founding designer at two YC companies.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"/about\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">About</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"border-t border-slate-200\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Kai Osei. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-600\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600\" /> Built with webma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-xl px-6 py-24 text-center\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-10 space-y-3 text-left\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={3} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"mt-4 w-full rounded-md bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Georgia',ui-serif,serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">About</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">Everything you need to know about how we approach design.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {