plore</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 via-emerald-50 to-orange-50 ring-1 ring-emerald-100\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-14 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-sm\">\n          <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-lg font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Skyline Realty</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">Skyline represents buyers and sellers across the metro's most sought-after neighborhoods.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"/listings\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Listings</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"border-t border-slate-200\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Skyline Realty. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-600\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600\" /> Built with webma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-10 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Tell us a bit about what you need — we'll take it from there.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-600\">\n            <p><span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Address</span><br />123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n            <p><span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Hours</span><br />Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <form className=\"space-y-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n          <button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">Listings</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">Real work, real results — see it for yourself.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-normal text-slate-900\">About Skyline Realty</h2>\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p className=\"text-slate-600\">We started Skyline Realty because the existing options in real estate were either too slow or too generic. Every decision here is made with our clients' actual outcomes in mind.</p>\n          <div className=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-orange-500\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n      <p className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium leading-snug text-slate-900\">&ldquo;5 bed · 4 bath · 3,600 sqft — corner lot, finished basement. That's exactly what Skyline Realty delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div className=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n        <div className=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100\" />\n        <div className=\"text-left\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Owen Clarke</p>\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Client</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"import { Zap, Star, Shield, Sparkles, Target, Heart, Award, TrendingUp, Users, Clock, CheckCircle, Compass } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Palatino',ui-serif,serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-normal text-slate-900\">What we offer</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Skyline Realty does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600\">\n            <Zap size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">142 Birchwood Ave</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">4 bed · 3 bath · 2,400 sqft — updated kitchen, private yard.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600\">\n            <Star size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">88 Harbor View Loft</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">2 bed · 2 bath · 1,300 sqft — floor-to-ceiling windows.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600\">\n            <Shield size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">27 Meridian Court</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">5 bed · 4 bath · 3,600 sqft — corner lot, finished basement.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600\">\n            <Sparkles size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">9 Willow Lane</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">3 bed · 2 bath · 1,850 sqft — move-in ready, quiet street.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Listings","path":"/listings","slug":"listings","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = 'c7565a68-4c04-4760-859e-ac97314604f4'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-white\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-3 items-center px-6 py-5\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Menu</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-center text-xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Ember & Oak</a>\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700\">Contact →</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] md:py-28\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-100 to-orange-100 ring-1 ring-orange-100 md:order-1\" />\n        <div className=\"md:order-2\">\n          <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-600\">RESTAURANT</span>\n          <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Dinner worth planning your week around.</h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-lg text-slate-600\">A wood-fired kitchen serving seasonal plates built around whatever's best at the market.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-orange-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-orange-700 transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n            <a href=\"#more\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-slate-600\">See how it works</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-4 border-t border-slate-100 px-6 py-10 text-center\">\n        <p className=\"font-sans text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Ember & Oak</p>\n        <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Menu</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n        <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Ember & Oak &middot; Built with <span className=\"text-orange-600\">webma</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-orange-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-orange-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-orange-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-orange-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-orange-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 text-center\">\n        <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-600\">A closer look at what we do and how we do it.</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Menu</h1>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-indigo-50 \" />\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About Ember & Oak</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-slate-600\">Ember & Oak pairs real experience in restaurant with a genuine focus on the people we work with — no jargon, no unnecessary steps, just results.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-0.5 text-orange-500\">{\"★★★★★\"}</div>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700\">&ldquo;Bone marrow butter, market greens. That's exactly what Ember & Oak delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Theo Kwan <span className=\"font-normal text-slate-400\">— Founder</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Location.tsx":"export default function Location() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-orange-600 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-3\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl font-bold\">Visit us</h2>\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-white/85\">123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-white/85\"><span className=\"font-semibold text-white\">Hours</span><br />Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"export default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">What we offer</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Ember & Oak does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 space-y-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-indigo-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Wood-fired trout</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Brown butter, capers, charred lemon.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-orange-50 md:order-2\" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Charred sourdough</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-indigo-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Roasted squash</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Whipped feta, pepitas, chili honey.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Menu","path":"/menu","slug":"menu","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Location","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '94631969-8339-4dc5-850e-e453a8e5464e'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"bg-teal-600\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold tracking-wide text-white\">Marrow</a>\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Menu</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-36\">\n        <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-teal-300\">RESTAURANT</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-wide\">A short menu, done exactly right.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/60\">Marrow changes eight dishes a week — nothing sits on the menu out of habit.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-500 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-teal-400 transition-colors\">Start now</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\">View details</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"font-sans text-xl font-bold tracking-wide\">Marrow</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm text-white/50\">Marrow changes eight dishes a week — nothing sits on the menu out of habit.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/40\">Stay in the loop</p>\n            <form className=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\" onSubmit={(e) => e.preventDefault()}>\n              <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@email.com\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/30 focus:border-teal-400 focus:outline-none\" />\n              <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-teal-400 transition-colors\">Join</button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Menu</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Contact</a>\n          </div>\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Marrow</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-xl px-6 py-24 text-center\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-10 space-y-3 text-left\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={3} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full border-b border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-1 py-3 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"mt-4 w-full rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-teal-600 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide\">Menu</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-white/75\">A closer look at what we do and how we do it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About Marrow</h2>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-600\">Behind Marrow is a small, focused team that cares more about doing the work right than doing a lot of it. That's shaped everything about how we operate.</p>\n        <div className=\"mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-600\">98%</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">Satisfaction</p></div>\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-600\">24/7</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">Support</p></div>\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-600\">50+</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">Team members</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-0.5 text-teal-500\">{\"★★★★★\"}</div>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700\">&ldquo;Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil. That's exactly what Marrow delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Alina Novak <span className=\"font-normal text-slate-400\">— Marketing Director</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Location.tsx":"export default function Location() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-teal-600 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-3\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl font-bold\">Visit us</h2>\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-white/85\">123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-white/85\"><span className=\"font-semibold text-white\">Hours</span><br />Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"export default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">What we offer</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Marrow does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Wood-fired trout</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Brown butter, capers, charred lemon.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Charred sourdough</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Roasted squash</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Whipped feta, pepitas, chili honey.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Dry-aged ribeye</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Bone marrow butter, market greens.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">House pappardelle</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Braised short rib ragu, pecorino.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50\" />\n          <div className=\"p-5\">\n            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Olive oil cake</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Citrus, mascarpone, toasted almond.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Menu","path":"/menu","slug":"menu","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Location","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = 'acef43a3-39e9-4065-8370-cbe0cf0e02d5'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Salt & Vine</a>\n        <div className=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Menu</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-amber-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Get in touch</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] md:py-28\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-100 to-amber-100 ring-1 ring-amber-100 md:order-1\" />\n        <div className=\"md:order-2\">\n          <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-600\">RESTAURANT</span>\n          <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Simple ingredients, taken seriously.</h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-lg text-slate-600\">A neighborhood table for people who care where dinner comes from.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-amber-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Get in touch</a>\n            <a href=\"#more\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-slate-600\">Explore</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"font-sans text-xl font-bold tracking-wide\">Salt & Vine</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm text-white/50\">A neighborhood table for people who care where dinner comes from.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/40\">Stay in the loop</p>\n            <form className=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\" onSubmit={(e) => e.preventDefault()}>\n              <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@email.com\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/30 focus:border-amber-400 focus:outline-none\" />\n              <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-amber-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors\">Join</button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Menu</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"hover:text-white\">Contact</a>\n          </div>\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Salt & Vine</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-amber-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Menu</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">A closer look at what we do and how we do it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About Salt & Vine</h2>\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p className=\"text-slate-600\">Salt & Vine is built around one idea: restaurant shouldn't be complicated. We keep things clear, direct, and focused on what actually moves the needle.</p>\n          <div className=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-slate-500\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-0.5 text-amber-500\">{\"★★★★★\"}</div>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700\">&ldquo;Brown butter, capers, charred lemon. That's exactly what Salt & Vine delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Jordan Lee <span className=\"font-normal text-slate-400\">— Operations Lead</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Location.tsx":"export default function Location() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Visit us</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600\">Hours</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"import { Zap, Star, Shield, Sparkles, Target, Heart, Award, TrendingUp, Users, Clock, CheckCircle, Compass } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">What we offer</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Salt & Vine does best.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-10 divide-y divide-slate-200\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Zap size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Wood-fired trout</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Brown butter, capers, charred lemon.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Star size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Charred sourdough</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Shield size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Roasted squash</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Whipped feta, pepitas, chili honey.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Sparkles size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Dry-aged ribeye</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Bone marrow butter, market greens.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Target size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">House pappardelle</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Braised short rib ragu, pecorino.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 py-5\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white text-amber-600 shadow-sm\"><Heart size={16} /></div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Olive oil cake</h3>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Citrus, mascarpone, toasted almond.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Menu","path":"/menu","slug":"menu","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Location","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '3886ee3f-1eb6-42c9-bac3-0494e335d4cf'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-white\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-3 items-center px-6 py-5\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Menu</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-center text-xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">The Copper Pot</a>\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700\">Contact →</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-36\">\n        <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-300\">RESTAURANT</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-wide\">Comfort food, uncompromised.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/60\">Family recipes, updated for a Tuesday night out.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-indigo-500 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-indigo-400 transition-colors\">Talk to us</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\">See examples</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer>\n      <div className=\"bg-indigo-600 text-white\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-4 px-6 py-14 text-center md:flex-row md:justify-between md:text-left\">\n          <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide\">Ready when you are.</h2>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors\">Get in touch</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"bg-white\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} The Copper Pot</p>\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Menu</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-10 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-600\">\n            <p><span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Address</span><br />123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n            <p><span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Hours</span><br />Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <form className=\"space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n          <button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 text-center\">\n        <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600\">A closer look at what we do and how we do it.</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Menu</h1>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">About The Copper Pot</h2>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-600\">We started The Copper Pot because the existing options in restaurant were either too slow or too generic. Every decision here is made with our clients' actual outcomes in mind.</p>\n        <div className=\"mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600\">1,200+</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">Projects delivered</p></div>\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600\">15</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">Industries served</p></div>\n          <div><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600\">99%</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">On-time delivery</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n      <p className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium leading-snug text-slate-900\">&ldquo;Braised short rib ragu, pecorino. That's exactly what The Copper Pot delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div className=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n        <div className=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100\" />\n        <div className=\"text-left\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Jordan Lee</p>\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Head of Growth</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Location.tsx":"export default function Location() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Visit us</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">123 Market Street, Suite 400</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600\">Hours</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-indigo-50\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"import { Zap, Star, Shield, Sparkles, Target, Heart, Award, TrendingUp, Users, Clock, CheckCircle, Compass } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-900\">What we offer</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what The Copper Pot does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Zap size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Wood-fired trout</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Brown butter, capers, charred lemon.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Star size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Charred sourdough</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Shield size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Roasted squash</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Whipped feta, pepitas, chili honey.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Sparkles size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Dry-aged ribeye</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Bone marrow butter, market greens.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Target size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">House pappardelle</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Braised short rib ragu, pecorino.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600\">\n            <Heart size={18} />\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Olive oil cake</h3>\n          <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Citrus, mascarpone, toasted almond.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Menu","path":"/menu","slug":"menu","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Location","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = '0cd38caf-2ad8-45f5-a193-2510bc3d0c76'::uuid;
UPDATE templates SET structure = $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"sticky top-4 z-40 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4\">\n      <nav className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/95 px-6 py-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Basecamp Labs</a>\n        <div className=\"hidden items-center gap-6 md:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/pricing\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-36\">\n        <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-teal-300\">SAAS</span>\n        <h1 className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] mt-6 text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight\">The workspace that scales with you, not against you.</h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/60\">From your first ten customers to your first ten thousand, Basecamp Labs doesn't need to be replaced.</p>\n        <div className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-500 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-teal-400 transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n          <a href=\"#more\" className=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\">See how it works</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-14 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-sm\">\n          <p className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Basecamp Labs</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">From your first ten customers to your first ten thousand, Basecamp Labs doesn't need to be replaced.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"/pricing\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"border-t border-slate-200\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Basecamp Labs. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-teal-600\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-600\" /> Built with webma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Get in touch</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within one business day.</p>\n      <form className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\" onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <div className=\"flex gap-0.5 text-teal-500\">{\"★★★★★\"}</div>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700\">&ldquo;Every change tracked, every rollback one click away. That's exactly what Basecamp Labs delivered.&rdquo;</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Nadia Farouk <span className=\"font-normal text-slate-400\">— Marketing Director</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Pricing.tsx":"import { Check } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Pricing() {\n  return (\n    <section id=\"pricing\" className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Simple, transparent pricing</h2>\n      <p className=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg text-slate-500\">Choose the plan that fits — upgrade or cancel any time.</p>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8\">\n          <p className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Starter</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-bold\">$29<span className=\"text-sm font-normal text-slate-400\">/mo</span></p>\n          <ul className=\"mt-6 space-y-2 text-left text-sm text-slate-600\">\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} /> Core features</li>\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} /> Email support</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"mt-6 block rounded-full py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold transition-colors border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400\">Choose Starter</a>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl bg-teal-600 text-white p-8\">\n          <p className=\"font-semibold text-white\">Growth</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-bold\">$79<span className=\"text-sm font-normal text-white/70\">/mo</span></p>\n          <ul className=\"mt-6 space-y-2 text-left text-sm text-white/85\">\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} /> Everything in Starter</li>\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} /> Priority support</li>\n            <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><Check size={14} /> Advanced reporting</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"mt-6 block rounded-full py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold transition-colors bg-white text-teal-700 hover:bg-white/90\">Choose Growth</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Stats.tsx":"export default function Stats() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-y border-slate-100 bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-2 gap-6 px-6 py-12 md:grid-cols-4\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 py-6 text-center\"><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-700\">98%</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-600/70\">Satisfaction</p></div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 py-6 text-center\"><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-700\">24/7</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-600/70\">Support</p></div>\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 py-6 text-center\"><p className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-teal-700\">50+</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-600/70\">Team members</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Features.tsx":"export default function Features() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-['Verdana',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif] text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">What Basecamp Labs offers</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A closer look at what Basecamp Labs does best.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 space-y-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Workflow automation</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Cut repetitive work out of your team's day.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100 to-teal-50 md:order-2\" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Real-time analytics</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Know what's working before your competitors do.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-rose-50 \" />\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Team workspaces</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 text-slate-500\">Give every team its own space without losing shared context.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"name":"Home","path":"/","slug":"index","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Stats","Features","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"name":"Pricing","path":"/pricing","slug":"pricing","sections":["Navbar","Pricing","Footer"]},{"name":"Contact","path":"/contact","slug":"contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb, thumbnail = $thumb$data:image/svg+xml;base64,$thumb$ WHERE id = 'da80e4e9-2d76-4ec8-ac7d-b310b1057b95'::uuid;
